# ---- ROS 2 / colcon build output ----
build/
install/
log/

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# ---- Editors / OS ----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Recorded run data and captured media
#
# The validation suite and the GUI capture scripts write several GB of raw
# per-run output: rosbags, per-topic CSV/JSON traces, node and launch logs,
# and full-session screen recordings. All of it is reproducible by re-running
# the harness, so this repository tracks the scripts, the analysis code and
# the written-up results rather than the raw output.
#
# Videos of the round trips are attached to the GitHub release instead of
# committed. See the "See it run" section of README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Screen recordings and rosbags
*.mp4
*.gif
*.mcap
*.mcap.zstd
*.db3
*.bag

# Raw numeric traces and per-run dumps
*.npz
*.csv
*.json
*.out
*.err

# Node, launch and driver logs from recorded sessions
*.log

# Whole-directory per-run output
recordings/**/data/
validation/phase8/**/*_logs/
visualization/doc_captures/
visualization/gui_diagnosis/
visualization/live_run/

# Point-in-time snapshot copies kept beside the live file during development.
# Git history is the record for these.
*.ORIGINAL
*.BEFORE_*
*.HEAVY.*

# ---- Force-tracked exceptions to the rules above ----
# Everything under docs/images/ is documentation imagery embedded in the docs,
# including the two animated GIFs in docs/retrospective.md. The *.gif and *.png
# rules above are aimed at captured session output, not at these.
!docs/images/**

# The authored two-floor layout, consumed by the world generator and the
# clearance checks. Small, and it documents the world's geometry.
!validation/phase8/floor2/floor2_layout.json

# ---- Further per-run output (same reasoning as above) ----
# Per-run verification dumps written by the harness for every single run.
*_verify.txt
*_health.txt
*_stdout.txt

# xacro expansions captured per configuration during the mesh/payload sweeps
validation/phase8/mesh_swap/**/*.urdf
*.urdf.xacro.fixed

# Harness completion markers
*.done
**/gui_recordings/**/data/
